Because your frontend already sends Debits as positive numbers and Credits as negative numbers, the math to validate this is actually incredibly elegant: **If we add all the amounts together for a specific group, the final sum must be exactly zero.**
Open **VoucherCommandService.java** and locate the createBatchRequest method. We are going to replace the simple totalDebit / totalCredit trackers with a strict map-based balancing engine.
